fix:
Combine the operations into a single bulk insert or batch transaction query.
```rust
fn insert_users_batched(db: &Database, users: Vec<User>) -> Result<(), Error> {
    let mut tx = db.begin_transaction()?;
    let query = "INSERT INTO users (name) VALUES ($1)";
    tx.execute_batch(query, users)?;
    tx.commit()?;
    Ok(())
}
```
